  "question": {
    "text": "If a circle drawn by assuming a chord parallel to the transverse axis of hyperbola <math><mfrac><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math> as diameter always passes through <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2,0</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>, then"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>≠</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "A"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "Let, the end points of the diameter of circle are <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">asec</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi>θ</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo><mi>b</mi><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">tan</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi>θ</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfenced></math> &amp; <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">asec</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi>θ</mi><mo>,</mo></mrow></mrow><mi>b</mi><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">tan</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi>θ</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo></math> Equation of circle is <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sec</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi>θ</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sec</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi>θ</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>b</mi><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">tan</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi>θ</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sec</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi>θ</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">tan</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi>θ</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>b</mi><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">tan</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi>θ</mi></mrow></mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br />Because <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2,0</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> satisfies above equation,<br />hence,&nbsp;<math><mn>4</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">tan</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi>θ</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">tan</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi>θ</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">tan</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi>θ</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br />Which is always true if <math><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math> &amp; <math><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math>"
  }
